<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Electron to buy back up to 15 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Electron to buy back up to 15 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo Electron Ltd said on Thursday that it would buy back up to 15 million of its own shares.</p>
<p>Tokyo Electron is a trading company specialising in semiconductor-related items.</p>
</text>
